# Clerk publishable key (from https://dashboard.clerk.com -> API Keys)
VITE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_ZGl2ZXJzZS1wYW5nb2xpbi02NS5jbGVyay5hY2NvdW50cy5kZXYk

# Backend API base URL.
# In development we use the relative /api path which is proxied by the Vite
# dev server (see vite.config.ts) to API_URL below — this avoids browser CORS
# issues. In production, point this at your real API origin.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api

# Real backend origin the /api and /socket.io dev-server proxy forwards to
# (see vite.config.ts). Not exposed to the browser — server-side only, read
# by Vite at dev-server startup. Defaults to https://cms-api.pixelspringmarketing.com
# when unset, so this line is only needed to point at a different backend
# (e.g. a local API on http://localhost:4000).
API_URL=https://cms-api.pixelspringmarketing.com